title: "Search Semantically — Large Language Models & Semantic Search"
abstract: >-
  A modular, beginner-to-expert open-source course on how modern search works: from
  classic keyword matching to embeddings, dense retrieval, re-ranking, evaluation, and
  Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG), with intuitive explanations and runnable notebooks.
